he-400.woff and he-600.woff are Hebrew-only subsets (U+0590-05FF, U+FB1D-FB4F,
U+20AA) of the Assistant variable font, fixed at weights 400 and 600.
Assistant: https://github.com/hafontia/Assistant
Licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, see OFL.txt.
They ship inside the launcher because a clean PS5 has no Hebrew font.
